{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやき坂46の井口眞緒です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は名古屋で全国握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんがとても優しくて、元気が出ました！！ありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくすごく楽しかったです(๑>◡<๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会の最後の締めも初めて体験しました！緊張しました！でも、菅井さんと締めができてすごく嬉しくて光栄でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"菅井さんが素敵な人すぎて、隣にいてどきどきしてしまいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"菅井さんがすごく優しくしてくれてずっと気遣ってくれて嬉しかったです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年ということでなんかすごく親近感が勝手に湧いていました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも同い年で同じＡＢ型ということでなんかすごく嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"菅井さんともっともっとお話ししたいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に写真も撮ってもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH46FZJHVAM5XXAYZYY5VEH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一緒に写真撮ってもらいたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いぐちまお "}],"source":"archive"}